	SKELEG
SkeleG is a software rasterizer written entirely in C, currently in version 0.1

WHAT CAN IT DO?
	Just rendering triangles... with pretty color interpolation (barycentric interpolation), that's it

HOW TO USE?
	Compile with make all, this will spit out skeleg.a, link that statically to whatever program you're making that uses SkeleG
	In your program, include skeleg.h